2: The `$i++` whose value is not read must be written `++$i`.
3: The `$j--` whose value is not read must be written `--$j`.
5: The `$a++` whose value is not read must be written `++$a`.
5: The `$b--` whose value is not read must be written `--$b`.
8: The `$f->g++` whose value is not read must be written `++$f->g`.
9: The `$h[0]++` whose value is not read must be written `++$h[0]`.
